- Always use the python environment `nespreso`. Use `conda` whenever possible,
- No satellite I/O inside `services/kernel/**`.
- No model inference inside `services/accessor/**`.
- Shared dataclasses live in `services/common/`.
- If new satellite variables are added, extend `FeatureVector` and update `normaliser.yaml`.